closure_audit
  issue 1138
  purpose "The honest count of distinct semantic references in seed data that resolve to no defined meaning, grounded source or override. Declaration identities, comments and literal matcher operands are classified by data/meta/total-closure-schema.lino and are not reference edges; the generator's own output is excluded from the definition set."
  plan "docs/case-studies/issue-1138/plans/09-handler-migration-ratchet.md leaves 6-8"
  defect "The total-closure metric is self-satisfying today. scripts/close-total.py writes data/seed/closure-generated-NN.lino and scripts/audit-total-closure.py then counts those generated glosses as definitions, so the gap it reports is zero by construction while 3,555 English-only glosses no runtime loads stand in for grounding."
  checker "tests/unit/total_closure.rs::seed_closure_gap_only_shrinks"
  measure_source "python3 scripts/audit-total-closure.py --json . reporting unresolved_distinct_honest"
  strict_direction "down. A value above the ceiling fails with grew; a value below it fails with improved, lower the reviewed ceiling. The rule is copied from scripts/check-minimal-core-boundary.rs lines 286-290."
  gate "data/meta/ci-gates/check-closure-audit.lino, running python3 scripts/check-closure-audit.py -- the cheap form of the unit test, so CI can answer the question without building the crate"
  ceiling
    measure unresolved_distinct_honest
    value 1088
    how "distinct unresolved semantic references reported by scripts/audit-total-closure.py. scripts/close-total.py reads the same canonical inventory for its grounding work list. The generated shards are gone as of plan 09 leaf 8, so there is no longer a second number: the honest count and the historical count are the same measurement."
    measured_on 2026-09-18
    note "the first honest run was 3585 over 9135 occurrences, measured with the 16 closure-generated shards still on disk. Plan 09 leaf 8 deleted them, taking the reviewed gap to 3569 over 6342 occurrences after subsequent seed changes. The assembled issue-1138 tree first appeared to grow that gap to 3902, but the increase was entirely a measurement defect: 187 full-line comments were parsed as data, while thousands of local response, pattern, family and evidence-group declaration identities and literal matcher operands had always been treated as meaning references. data/meta/total-closure-schema.lino now declares 32 identity-bearing heads and four literal-operand heads; structural code excludes an identity only on a branch, so a leaf such as intent greeting remains audited. The corrected inventory excludes 2777 distinct declaration identities and 107 distinct literal operands, and scripts/close-total.py reads that same inventory rather than maintaining a second parser. Thirteen genuine method and selection identifiers introduced or exercised by the assembled runtime are grounded with authored five-field metadata in meanings-agent-actions.lino. Twenty-five response intents introduced when hardcoded runtime messages moved into seed data are also defined there rather than hidden by raising the ceiling. That correction produced the previous reviewed gap of 1102 distinct references over 3926 occurrences against 1218 honest defined meanings. On 2026-09-18 the plan 10 routing work grew the honest measure to 1123 -- eight new selection identifiers in the capability-routing table (glob, read_many, multi_edit, todo, subagent, path_set, task_list, delegation) plus callable, which the assembled tree had exercised since the reviewed value was recorded -- and the same rule applied: the growth is grounded, not ceilinged. All thirty-five declared routing-vocabulary identifiers that the audit counted as references (the table's capabilities, objects, acts, loci, and its default ask, plus callable) are now defined with authored five-field metadata in meanings-routing-vocabulary.lino, a seed part the runtime embeds. The reviewed gap stands at 1088 distinct references over 3936 occurrences against 1312 honest defined meanings. This is genuine grounding, not a claim that the excluded schema data became meanings."
